      "diff": {
        "patch": "diff --git a/SUMMARY.md b/SUMMARY.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..557731a\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/SUMMARY.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+# Repository Summary\n+\n+This repository is a minimal Fabro (https://docs.fabro.computer) demo project. It contains no application source code — only a `.fabro` directory with configuration for the Fabro workflow engine. The project configuration (`.fabro/project.toml`) enables auto-creation of draft pull requests on successful workflow runs, and a single example workflow (`.fabro/workflows/hello/`) defines a simple \"Hello\" graph (Start → Greet → Exit) that prompts the agent to introduce itself as a test of the workflow engine. The repo has a single commit (\"chore: add initial fabro project configuration\") and no README or documentation files.\n",
